Dear Minister,

I write to notify you that Judicial Review proceedings have been issued and=
 served in the matter Zahmoul v Secretary of State for Justice & HMCTS (AC-2=
025-LON-004293).

Among other issues, the claim raises significant concerns regarding:
=E2=80=A2 the failure to identify or record the needs of a disabled litigant,
=E2=80=A2 the absence of appropriate participation measures, and
=E2=80=A2 administrative actions which contributed to clinical destabilisation.

These matters sit alongside allegations of misadministration of court-contr=
olled electronic material with potential criminal relevance.

Given your responsibilities relating to disability policy and safeguarding,=
 this update is provided for transparency.

A public archive of filed documents is available at:
https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/JR-Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Archive

Yours sincerely,
Nadia Zahmoul

